---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../../lib/siteUrl';
---

<Layout title="Tutorials" description="Start with Varve's step-by-step getting-started guides, then go deeper with feature-by-feature documentation for vector, typography, motion, and export.">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="learn-page">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href={sitePath('/learn')}>Learn</a> / Tutorials
      </nav>

      <h1>Tutorials</h1>
      <p class="learn-intro">
        Dedicated, written tutorials are still being developed. Until they exist, these are the
        real guides available today: step-by-step walkthroughs to get oriented, and feature
        documentation to go deeper on a specific tool.
      </p>

      <h2 class="learn-subheading">Start here</h2>
      <div class="tutorials-grid">
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <h3>Getting Started</h3>
          <p>
            Install Varve, open the app for the first time, and understand what a beta release
            means in practice.
          </p>
          <div class="tutorial-meta">
            <span class="tutorial-tag">Step-by-step guide</span>
          </div>
          <a href={sitePath('/docs/getting-started')} class="btn-secondary">Read the guide</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <h3>Interface Overview</h3>
          <p>
            A tour of the toolbar, canvas, layers panel, inspector, timeline, status bar, and
            workspace modes.
          </p>
          <div class="tutorial-meta">
            <span class="tutorial-tag">Step-by-step guide</span>
          </div>
          <a href={sitePath('/docs/getting-started/interface')} class="btn-secondary">Read the guide</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <h3>Your First Project</h3>
          <p>
            Create a document, add shapes and text, and export your first file.
          </p>
          <div class="tutorial-meta">
            <span class="tutorial-tag">Step-by-step guide</span>
          </div>
          <a href={sitePath('/docs/getting-started/first-project')} class="btn-secondary">Read the guide</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="learn-subheading">Go deeper by feature</h2>
      <p class="learn-subintro">
        These describe what each tool does and its current status — useful for understanding
        capabilities, not yet written as click-by-click walkthroughs.
      </p>
      <div class="tutorials-grid">
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <h3>Vector Tools</h3>
          <p>
            Shape primitives, pen and pencil with bezier handles, node editing, and boolean
            operations.
          </p>
          <div class="tutorial-meta">
            <span class="tutorial-tag tutorial-tag-alt">Feature guide</span>
          </div>
          <a href={sitePath('/features/vector-tools')} class="btn-secondary">See the feature guide</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <h3>Typography</h3>
          <p>
            Paragraph and character styling, OpenType features, variable fonts, and
            text-on-path.
          </p>
          <div class="tutorial-meta">
            <span class="tutorial-tag tutorial-tag-alt">Feature guide</span>
          </div>
          <a href={sitePath('/features/typography')} class="btn-secondary">See the feature guide</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <h3>Motion & Prototyping</h3>
          <p>
            Timeline animation, keyframes, easing, Smart Animate, and prototype interactions.
          </p>
          <div class="tutorial-meta">
            <span class="tutorial-tag tutorial-tag-alt">Feature guide</span>
          </div>
          <a href={sitePath('/features/motion')} class="btn-secondary">See the feature guide</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <h3>Export & Code Generation</h3>
          <p>
            Export to SVG, React, Flutter, SwiftUI, and PDF, with per-node export settings.
          </p>
          <div class="tutorial-meta">
            <span class="tutorial-tag tutorial-tag-alt">Feature guide</span>
          </div>
          <a href={sitePath('/features/export')} class="btn-secondary">See the feature guide</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-cta">
        <h2>Want to write one?</h2>
        <p>Structured, task-based tutorials are on the roadmap but not yet written. See the <a href={sitePath('/contribute')}>contribution guidelines</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .learn-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .learn-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-family: var(--font-editorial);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .learn-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .learn-subheading {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .learn-subintro {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .tutorials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .tutorial-card {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: all var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-default);
  }

  .tutorial-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .tutorial-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .tutorial-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tutorial-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tutorial-tag {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--surface-accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .tutorial-tag-alt {
    background: var(--surface-muted);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .learn-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  }

  .learn-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .learn-cta p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
</style>
